<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  FOTOSYNTHESE IN 13 VRAAGVORMEN: dezelfde kennis, elke interactiesoort één keer.
  - nonlinear + individual: de vragen staan onder elkaar (navigate="section") en je maakt ze in eigen volgorde.
  - qti-item-session-control: 1 poging, feedback tonen (show-feedback="true").
  - Nakijken kan pas nadat er een antwoord is gekozen: dat is de keuze van de pagina (require-answer op de knop), niet van de QTI.
-->
<qti-assessment-test xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="vraagtypen" title="Fotosynthese in 13 vraagvormen" xml:lang="nl-NL">
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" base-type="float" cardinality="single">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="MAXSCORE" base-type="float" cardinality="single">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="PERCENTAGE" base-type="float" cardinality="single">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" base-type="identifier" cardinality="single" />

  <qti-test-part identifier="TEST-PART" navigation-mode="nonlinear" submission-mode="individual">
    <qti-item-session-control max-attempts="1" show-feedback="true" />
    <qti-assessment-section identifier="SECTION" title="Fotosynthese" visible="true">
      <qti-rubric-block use="instructions" view="candidate" class="qti-rubric-discretionary-placement">
        <qti-content-body>
          <p>Dezelfde kennis, dertien verschillende vragen: elke vraag gaat over <strong>fotosynthese</strong>, maar steeds in een andere vraagvorm. Je hebt per vraag <strong>één poging</strong>. Na <em>Nakijken</em> zie je meteen of je antwoord goed is, met een korte uitleg.</p>
          <p><img src="resources/plate-overview.jpg" alt="Een plant in de zon: pijlen laten zien wat het blad in en uit gaat en hoe water uit de wortels omhoog komt." width="1200" height="800"/></p>
        </qti-content-body>
      </qti-rubric-block>
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM001-TEST" href="ITEM001.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM002-TEST" href="ITEM002.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM003-TEST" href="ITEM003.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM004-TEST" href="ITEM004.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM005-TEST" href="ITEM005.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM006-TEST" href="ITEM006.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM007-TEST" href="ITEM007.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM008-TEST" href="ITEM008.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM009-TEST" href="ITEM009.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM010-TEST" href="ITEM010.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM011-TEST" href="ITEM011.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM012-TEST" href="ITEM012.xml" />
      <qti-assessment-item-ref identifier="ITEM013-TEST" href="ITEM013.xml" />
    </qti-assessment-section>
  </qti-test-part>
  <qti-outcome-processing>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE">
      <qti-sum><qti-test-variables variable-identifier="SCORE" /></qti-sum>
    </qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="MAXSCORE">
      <qti-sum><qti-test-variables variable-identifier="MAXSCORE" /></qti-sum>
    </qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="PERCENTAGE">
      <qti-product>
        <qti-divide><qti-variable identifier="SCORE" /><qti-variable identifier="MAXSCORE" /></qti-divide>
        <qti-base-value base-type="float">100</qti-base-value>
      </qti-product>
    </qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-outcome-condition>
      <qti-outcome-if>
        <qti-gte><qti-variable identifier="PERCENTAGE" /><qti-base-value base-type="float">80</qti-base-value></qti-gte>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">UITSTEKEND</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-outcome-if>
      <qti-outcome-else-if>
        <qti-gte><qti-variable identifier="PERCENTAGE" /><qti-base-value base-type="float">55</qti-base-value></qti-gte>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">VOLDOENDE</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-outcome-else-if>
      <qti-outcome-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">ONVOLDOENDE</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-outcome-else>
    </qti-outcome-condition>
  </qti-outcome-processing>
  <qti-test-feedback identifier="UITSTEKEND" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" access="atEnd">
    <qti-content-body><p>Uitstekend! Je hebt 80% of meer goed. Je kent de fotosynthese in elke vraagvorm.</p></qti-content-body>
  </qti-test-feedback>
  <qti-test-feedback identifier="VOLDOENDE" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" access="atEnd">
    <qti-content-body><p>Voldoende: je hebt 55% of meer goed. Lees de uitleg bij de vragen die fout gingen nog eens na.</p></qti-content-body>
  </qti-test-feedback>
  <qti-test-feedback identifier="ONVOLDOENDE" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show" access="atEnd">
    <qti-content-body><p>Je hebt minder dan 55% goed. Herhaal de stof: planten maken met licht, koolstofdioxide en water glucose en zuurstof.</p></qti-content-body>
  </qti-test-feedback>
</qti-assessment-test>
